      "cooked": "<p>We were playing against Akash'bhuta last nigth and I wasn't sure whether or not I could use my base power as Nightmist due to it requiring me to damage myself and one of the limbs, the brambles I think, prevents the lowest HP player from doing damage. &nbsp;Does that make it so I can't use my power?</p>",
